{
  "id": "GAL.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Abagalatia 5",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chora Kristo gose amachiiko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kristo agatosibora, erinde tomenye ase obosibore; gaki tenena bokong’u, timobwatwa naende ase obosibwa bw’obosomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igwa, inche Paulo nkobateebia nde inwe, ng’a moise kwarokigwa, rirorio Kristo takoba nengencho ende ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ngoteebia nde kera omonto oyokwarokigwa, ng’a rirorio osibirwe ase ogoikerania amachiiko onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwatananirwe korwa ase Kristo, inwe abamorigetie konyora oboronge korwa ase amachiiko, mwagure korwa ase obuya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki intwe ase Omoika ntoganyete oboronge boria tosemeretie ase enchera y’okwegena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki ase Kristo Yeso okwaroka tikogokonyorera kende, gose ogotaroka, korende okwegena okwo nakwo kogokora emeremo ase obwanchani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo mwarenge kominyoka buya; ning’o obatangete timoigwera ekeene?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoebereria okwo tikwarwete asare ere oyobarangeretie inwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ememera emeke nigo ekobotia ribomba rigima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase Omonene ninde nogosemeria ase more ng’a timokoba nebirengererio binde ebiao, korende ere oyokobachanda nabogorie okogambigwa kwaye, naba onde bwensi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende baminto, onye inche ngendererete nonya mbono koraria amang’ana y’okwaroka, nase ki rende nkona‐gochandwa? Igo ekegocha ki’omosalaba kiarusigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anga nancha ng’a abwo bakobachanda begombayie abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obosibore goika bogamberwe nobwanchani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abaminto, nigo mwarangeretigwe monyore obosibore; korende ogosiborwa kwaino tikoba ogw’okobwatia chingencho chiaino chi’ebibe, mbuya mokorerane inwe ase inwe ase obwanchani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki amachiiko onsi aikeranigwe ase ring’ana erimo, na rirorio nario eri, “Mwanche omogisangio oo buna bweanchete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende kerabe mokoromana na koriana, rigereria timocha gosirania inwe ase inwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okwama kw’Omoika na ogokora gwe chingencho chi’ebibe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki nigo nkobateebia, mogenderere ase Omoika na timogoikerania okogania gwe chingencho chiaino chi’ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki okogania gwe chingencho chi’ebibe nigo gokoamererania n’Omoika na okogania kw’Omoika nigo gokoamererania ne chingencho chi’ebibe; naki ebi iga bikorwana goika timokonyara gokora ayamorigetie gokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende komokoraagwa n’Omoika, rirorio timori inse y’amachiiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogokora gwe chingencho chi’ebibe nigo kore maiso marore na korokwo nobotomani, eubi, obonyaka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogosasiima emegwekano, oborogi, obobisa, eriomana, ribero, endamwamu, obong’iti, okwerusanania, ogweatanana,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emoko, oboiti, ogotinda, chigosori chimbe, na amang’ana ande buna ayio. Nabakuureire buna narenge kobakuurera ritang’ani, ng’a abwo bagokora amang’ana anga buna ayio, tibakonyora omwando bw’oborwoti bwa Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende okwama kw’Omoika nobwanchani, omogooko, omorembe, oboremereria, obwororo, obuya, obwegenwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oboitongo, okwerita ase onsi; machiko ande tari arange amang’ana buna ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo bare abakristo Yeso baabambire chingencho chiabo chi’ebibe amo nokogania okobe na okorengereria kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye intwe twabeire moyo ase Omoika, togenderere boigo ase Omoika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Titoba nokogania kw’ogwetogia abanyene, titochegania, gose koba nemoko intwe ase intwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "GAL.6",
    "number": "6",
